	(text "U8 TXB0104: A=1.8V (VDD_EXT), B=3V3. A1<->B1 carries MCU TX -> modem MAIN_RXD(68); A2<->B2 modem MAIN_TXD(67) -> MCU RX; A3 RI(62); A4 DTR(66). OE held low until VDD_EXT rises."
